WEBVTT

00:02:56.205 --> 00:03:00.937
W frawha w huma šadin mliḥ f fekra't bla-teɛnaf.

00:03:00.937 --> 00:03:08.104
Tkakaw belli el-teɛnaf mɛa el-teɛnaf

00:03:08.104 --> 00:03:13.300
ma yfidš.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.493
'Ammala weš huwa elli yfid?

00:03:15.493 --> 00:03:18.962
Mɛa el-weqt, lemmit waḥed el-ṭnaš n' sira

00:03:18.962 --> 00:03:20.795
tfid - bayna belli kayen tanik waḥduxrin-:

00:03:20.795 --> 00:03:23.141
tfid w ɛendha ma tɛawen ṣeḥḥ.

00:03:23.141 --> 00:03:24.508
el-'ewwel huwa:

00:03:24.508 --> 00:03:27.026
el-tebdal elli lazem yeṣra

00:03:27.026 --> 00:03:31.491
lazem yeṣra hna, fi dati.